config NIMBLE_STORE_SETTINGS_FILE_SIZE
    int "Store file size in bytes"
    depends on NIMBLE_BLE_STORE_CONFIG_PERSIST
    default 4096
    help
      Space the settings file of the store may use. The store keeps the
      keys of up to BLE_STORE_MAX_BONDS peers and BLE_STORE_MAX_CCCDS
      subscriptions; the file needs room to rewrite them as they change.
